{"type":"message","id":"2d38d48e","parentId":"243261f8","timestamp":"2026-03-21T13:25:00.876Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:106e696d-bc8d-42d3-abb0-04615635dafc 每日晨报] 执行以下几个任务，并将执行后的结果以飞书文档的形式发到飞书消息中：\n1. 全网搜索国际新闻，并按照其影响力大小进行排序（尤其是对我个人的影响），将前10条新闻调用summarize技能进行总结，要求提供每条新闻对应的出处和链接，可以直接通过链接查看详细的新闻信息；\n2. 全网搜索半导体\\芯片行业的新闻，调用summarize技能进行总结，要求提供每条新闻对应的出处和链接，可以直接通过链接查看详细的新闻信息；\nCurrent time: Saturday, March 21st, 2026 — 21:25 (Asia/Shanghai) / 2026-03-21 13:25 UTC\n\nReturn your summary as plain text; it will be delivered automatically. If the task explicitly calls for messaging a specific external recipient, note who/where it should go instead of sending it yourself."}],"timestamp":1774099500866}}
{"type":"message","id":"612e9c9c","parentId":"2d38d48e","timestamp":"2026-03-21T13:25:04.148Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_lcos99rivm2k7lb87c99zn17","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"~/.openclaw/skills/summarize/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774099500871}}
{"type":"message","id":"b5cce460","parentId":"612e9c9c","timestamp":"2026-03-21T13:25:04.192Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_lcos99rivm2k7lb87c99zn17","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: summarize\ndescription: 智能内容摘要工具，支持长文本、文档、网页、聊天记录的摘要生成。支持要点提取、关键词提炼、摘要长度自定义。当用户需要总结内容、提取要点、精简长文时使用。\n---\n\n# Summarize 智能摘要技能\n\n## 核心功能\n- 📄 **文本摘要**：支持任意长度文本的摘要生成，保留核心信息\n- 📑 **文档摘要**：支持PDF、Word、Markdown等多种文档格式的摘要\n- 🌐 **网页摘要**：自动提取网页内容并生成摘要\n- 💬 **聊天摘要**：总结长对话、会议记录、聊天历史的核心内容\n- 🎯 **要点提取**：自动提取内容的核心要点和关键信息\n- 🔑 **关键词提取**：提炼内容的核心关键词和主题\n- ⚡ **自定义长度**：支持短摘要（100字）、中摘要（300字）、长摘要（1000字）等不同长度\n\n## 摘要算法\n- **抽取式摘要**：从原文中提取最重要的句子组成摘要\n- **生成式摘要**：使用大模型重新组织语言生成流畅的摘要\n- **混合模式**：结合两种模式的优点，既准确又流畅\n\n## 使用示例\n```python\ndef summarize_text(text, max_length=300, extract_keywords=True):\n    \"\"\"\n    生成文本摘要\n    :param text: 要摘要的文本\n    :param max_length: 摘要最大长度\n    :param extract_keywords: 是否提取关键词\n    :return: 摘要结果\n    \"\"\"\n    # 摘要逻辑实现\n    return {\n        \"summary\": \"生成的摘要内容\",\n        \"keywords\": [\"关键词1\", \"关键词2\", \"关键词3\"],\n        \"key_points\": [\"要点1\", \"要点2\", \"要点3\"],\n        \"original_length\": len(text),\n        \"summary_length\": 280\n    }\n```\n\n## 触发场景\n- 用户需要总结长文本、文档、网页内容\n- 需要提取文章的核心要点和关键词\n- 总结会议记录、聊天历史、讨论内容\n- 精简长文档，方便快速阅读\n- 生成内容的简介、梗概、摘要\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774099504189}}
{"type":"message","id":"a762efed","parentId":"b5cce460","timestamp":"2026-03-21T13:25:06.429Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_cf1fhwa79mnx6huty28oenys","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"~/.openclaw/skills/multi-search-engine/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774099504193}}
{"type":"message","id":"34ff0200","parentId":"a762efed","timestamp":"2026-03-21T13:25:06.433Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_cf1fhwa79mnx6huty28oenys","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: \"multi-search-engine\"\ndescription: \"Multi search engine integration with 17 engines (8 CN + 9 Global). Supports advanced search operators, time filters, site search, privacy engines, and WolframAlpha knowledge queries. No API keys required.\"\n---\n\n# Multi Search Engine v2.0.1\n\nIntegration of 17 search engines for web crawling without API keys.\n\n## Search Engines\n\n### Domestic (8)\n- **Baidu**: `https://www.baidu.com/s?wd={keyword}`\n- **Bing CN**: `https://cn.bing.com/search?q={keyword}&ensearch=0`\n- **Bing INT**: `https://cn.bing.com/search?q={keyword}&ensearch=1`\n- **360**: `https://www.so.com/s?q={keyword}`\n- **Sogou**: `https://sogou.com/web?query={keyword}`\n- **WeChat**: `https://wx.sogou.com/weixin?type=2&query={keyword}`\n- **Toutiao**: `https://so.toutiao.com/search?keyword={keyword}`\n- **Jisilu**: `https://www.jisilu.cn/explore/?keyword={keyword}`\n\n### International (9)\n- **Google**: `https://www.google.com/search?q={keyword}`\n- **Google HK**: `https://www.google.com.hk/search?q={keyword}`\n- **DuckDuckGo**: `https://duckduckgo.com/html/?q={keyword}`\n- **Yahoo**: `https://search.yahoo.com/search?p={keyword}`\n- **Startpage**: `https://www.startpage.com/sp/search?query={keyword}`\n- **Brave**: `https://search.brave.com/search?q={keyword}`\n- **Ecosia**: `https://www.ecosia.org/search?q={keyword}`\n- **Qwant**: `https://www.qwant.com/?q={keyword}`\n- **WolframAlpha**: `https://www.wolframalpha.com/input?i={keyword}`\n\n## Quick Examples\n\n```javascript\n// Basic search\nweb_fetch({\"url\": \"https://www.google.com/search?q=python+tutorial\"})\n\n// Site-specific\nweb_fetch({\"url\": \"https://www.google.com/search?q=site:github.com+react\"})\n\n// File type\nweb_fetch({\"url\": \"https://www.google.com/search?q=machine+learning+filetype:pdf\"})\n\n// Time filter (past week)\nweb_fetch({\"url\": \"https://www.google.com/search?q=ai+news&tbs=qdr:w\"})\n\n// Privacy search\nweb_fetch({\"url\": \"https://duckduckgo.com/html/?q=privacy+tools\"})\n\n// DuckDuckGo Bangs\nweb_fetch({\"url\": \"https://duckduckgo.com/html/?q=!gh+tensorflow\"})\n\n// Knowledge calculation\nweb_fetch({\"url\": \"https://www.wolframalpha.com/input?i=100+USD+to+CNY\"})\n```\n\n## Advanced Operators\n\n| Operator | Example | Description |\n|----------|---------|-------------|\n| `site:` | `site:github.com python` | Search within site |\n| `filetype:` | `filetype:pdf report` | Specific file type |\n| `\"\"` | `\"machine learning\"` | Exact match |\n| `-` | `python -snake` | Exclude term |\n| `OR` | `cat OR dog` | Either term |\n\n## Time Filters\n\n| Parameter | Description |\n|-----------|-------------|\n| `tbs=qdr:h` | Past hour |\n| `tbs=qdr:d` | Past day |\n| `tbs=qdr:w` | Past week |\n| `tbs=qdr:m` | Past month |\n| `tbs=qdr:y` | Past year |\n\n## Privacy Engines\n\n- **DuckDuckGo**: No tracking\n- **Startpage**: Google results + privacy\n- **Brave**: Independent index\n- **Qwant**: EU GDPR compliant\n\n## Bangs Shortcuts (DuckDuckGo)\n\n| Bang | Destination |\n|------|-------------|\n| `!g` | Google |\n| `!gh` | GitHub |\n| `!so` | Stack Overflow |\n| `!w` | Wikipedia |\n| `!yt` | YouTube |\n\n## WolframAlpha Queries\n\n- Math: `integrate x^2 dx`\n- Conversion: `100 USD to CNY`\n- Stocks: `AAPL stock`\n- Weather: `weather in Beijing`\n\n## Documentation\n\n- `references/advanced-search.md` - Domestic search guide\n- `references/international-search.md` - International search guide\n- `CHANGELOG.md` - Version history\n\n## License\n\nMIT\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774099506431}}
